From: krita-wasm-sdk contributors
Subject: [PATCH] filesystem: use the unknown-type fallback for WebAssembly

Browser virtual filesystems do not expose the host filesystem type.
Reuse the existing Unknown result rather than selecting an undefined
Unix statfs implementation or claiming a desktop filesystem type.

Applies to: KCoreAddons 6.24.0
Upstream status: local Wasm porting patch, not submitted

diff --git a/src/lib/io/kfilesystemtype.cpp b/src/lib/io/kfilesystemtype.cpp
--- a/src/lib/io/kfilesystemtype.cpp
+++ b/src/lib/io/kfilesystemtype.cpp
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@
     const char *name = nullptr;
 };
 
-#ifndef Q_OS_WIN
+#if !defined(Q_OS_WIN) && !defined(Q_OS_WASM)
 // clang-format off
 static constexpr FsInfo s_fsMap[] = {
     {KFileSystemType::Nfs, "nfs"},
